OL,3,GNEWSAFirst Minister's Questions -
OL,4,ASwinney and Offord clash over homeless
OL,5,Arefugees
OL,6,
OL,7,FReform leader Malcolm Offord raises
OL,8,Fimmigration concerns at First
OL,9,FMinister's Questions, with John Swinney
OL,10,Faccusing him of "trying to drive this
OL,11,Fcountry apart"
OL,13,FLabour's Jackie Baillie asks Swinney
OL,14,Fabout violence against women and girls
OL,15,Fand raises the cases of Stacy Hunter
OL,16,Fand Claire Inglis
OL,18,FRoss Greer, of the Scottish Greens,
OL,19,Fasks about data centres, with Swinney
OL,20,Fsaying the government "will give
OL,21,Ffurther consideration" to the issue
